    narr:narration """Dave Quantum's single dated appearance (Aug 23, 2026) is a database migration announcement delivered as a settled decision with supporting rationale. He opens declaratively — [switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1) — then immediately supplies the business case: [10x query performance, lower licensing cost](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2). The same content is restated in summary-bullet form — [migration bullet](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3), [performance bullet](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4), [timeline at Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5). The conviction holds at \"decision\" throughout, but the power footing shifts: the announcement is informational, the rationale leans on rational-persuasion, and the timeline introduces pressure. His register moves between technical (the decision itself) and matter-of-fact (the benefits and schedule). All five children are from the same moment; there is no trajectory across dates, only the arc of a single announcement from declaration to justification to scheduling.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Database migration**: PostgreSQL → QuantumDB" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The performance claim narrows between the rationale (\"10x query performance\") and the summary bullet (\"10x analytical queries\") — a scope refinement from general to analytical." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The power footing shifts from informational (announcement) through rational-persuasion (rationale) to pressure (timeline) — the same decision tightens as it moves from declaration to schedule." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "conviction" ; narr:reading "decision-stamped — states the migration as settled, not proposed or hedged" ; narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ] ;
    narr:voiceTrait [ narr:dim "register" ; narr:reading "technical when declaring, matter-of-fact when justifying — benefits are stated as line items, not argued" ; narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ] ;
